item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat13\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump\" id=\"6872872\">Sewage Submersible Pump</a><ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch\" id=\"6872928\">SS Submersible Sewage Pump with Float Switch</a></li>\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/submersible-sewage-pump-with-grinder\" id=\"6872929\">Submersible Sewage Pump with Grinder</a></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat14\"><a href=\"/self-suction-screw-pump\" id=\"6872880\">Self Suction Screw Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat15\"><a href=\"/submersible-solar-pump\" id=\"7719400\">Submersible Solar Pump</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"con_title\">Contact Us</div>\n<div class=\"contact_box\"><p>JD Frontier</p><p>ADD: City Saddar Road, Rawalpindi, Pakistan</p><p>TEL: <a href=\"tel:+92515553023\">051-5553023</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pro_right\">\n<div class=\"pror_wrap\">\n<div class=\"pror_detail\">\n<div class=\"fl\"><div class=\"singglepic\"><img alt=\"3 Inch Brass Impeller Peripheral Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/3-submersible-peripheral-pump-03542632838.jpg\"/></div><link href=\"/images/spic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/></div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">3 Inch Brass Impeller Peripheral Pump</h1>\n<p>3'' submersible peripheral pump JIADI has been a leading pump manufacturer in the world for over 25 years. At JIADI, we offer products for different applications. We are proud to be a water pump manufacturer and supplier offering products like 3'' submersible peripheral pump to...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"65155814\"/></p><p><strong>3 inch Brass Impeller Peripheral Pump</strong></p><p><img alt=\"image004(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270906177213451.jpg\"/></p><p>JIADI has been a leading pump manufacturer in the world for over 25 years. It has large impact on subemrsible pump area for JIADI people have spent both time and energy on developing, designing and improving submersible pump. They hope and desire to bring the best product and to make JIADI the best in this area.</p><p><strong>1. Product specification</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"word-break: break-all;\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">Series</p></td><td style=\"word-break: break-all;\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">SK</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Motor Power Type</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Body Material</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Stainless Steel</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Brand Name</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Max. Head</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">73m</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Q Max.</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">2.5m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Motor Power</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">0.55/0.75/1.1kW- 0.75/1/1.5HP</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Motor:</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">oil filled, 100% Copper Wire</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Item Shape</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Round</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">&gt;80mm(30&amp;rdquo;)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Pump Length</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">478/ 535/ 602mm in this series</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">1 inch</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"word-break: break-all;\">Highest temperature water bearable</td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">Warranty Description</p></td><td style=\"word-break: break-all;\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">12 Months</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270908198248189.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; word-break: break-all;\"><p>Copper Motor<br/><img alt=\"image006(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270909354989768.jpg\"/></p><p>100% copper<br/></p></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; word-break: break-all;\"><p>Pump Shaft</p><p> <img alt=\"image007(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270909448325699.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&amp;middot;stronger and harder<br/>\n\t\t\t&amp;middot;no distortion</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"text-align:left\">Plastic Impeller </p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img alt=\"image008(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270910404166875.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&amp;middot;Highly durable copper impeller<br/>\n\t\t\t&amp;middot;Bearing high flow rate and pressure<br/>\n\t\t\t&amp;middot;Protected by the impeller case</p></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"text-align:left\">Mechanical Seal<br/><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270910534263490.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&amp;middot;Super-high precision Carborundum Graphite mechanical seal<br/>\n\t\t\t&amp;middot;Water and sand proof keep the motor safe</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><p>Control Box<br/><img alt=\"image010(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270911042171477.jpg\"/></p><p>&amp;middot;Protecting the motor in case it burned down<br/>\n\t\t\t&amp;middot;Various standard plug<br/>\n\t\t\t&amp;middot;Fire-resistant materials</p></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><p>Cable<br/><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270911145663955.jpg\"/></p><p>&amp;middot;Four cores cable<br/>\n\t\t\t&amp;middot;Rubber protecting the wire<br/>\n\t\t\t&amp;middot;Various colors available</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Product Introduction</strong></p><p>SKM series pump consists of copper impellers, stainless steel casing and so on.<br/></p><p><strong>5. Product application</strong></p><p>JIADI pump is widely used in agricultural irrigation, sprinkler irrigation, wells for water, living water, industrial and civil construction of water supply and drainage systems, as well as water, drainage and other low-lying areas of the hilly area occasions.</p><p><img alt=\"image012(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270912001182463.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Benefits</strong></p><p>1).Competitive price. The larger the order is, the more competitive the price will be.</p><p>2).Perfect After-Sale Service. Free technical support after-sale.</p><p>3).One year guarantee time. Spare parts will be offered to replace the broken one within this period.</p><p>4).Various kinds of models available.</p><p>5).We accept customized products for your special requirement.</p><p>6).We&amp;rsquo;re a factory with good product quality control and loading time control</p><p><strong>7. Certification</strong></p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411154549302.jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"vertical-align:middle\">ISO14001</td><td style=\"vertical-align:middle\">OHSAS18001</td><td style=\"vertical-align:middle\">CE </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411169751193.jpg\"/></p><p> </p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"vertical-align:middle\">GS </td><td style=\"vertical-align:middle\">ISO9001</td><td style=\"vertical-align:middle\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The quality of our products could not be denied for we have got those certificates to guarantee it. As time went by, our technique becomes more professional and reliable and our attitudes become more rigorous.</p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: Could you please let us know the demands of flow,head and so on you require so that we can recommend the suitable pump?</strong></p><p>A. Diameter for the borehole, pond or well .</p><p>B. Water flow per hour</p><p>C. lift from lowest water level to ground</p><p>D. Vertical height from tank (if any) to ground </p><p>E. Horizontal distance between borehole and tank</p><p><strong>2. Q: Do you have skype?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, we have skype, Wechat, alibaba and so on. You can add any of them for further communication, or you can email us. We will reply your question ASAP within 24 hours.</p><p><strong>3. How can you make sure the quality of the products?</strong></p><p>A: We will inspect every item before leaving our factory according to international quality standards and each procedure will be rigorously supervised by our team members. </p><p> </p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 3 inch brass impeller peripheral pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/2-5-submersible-pump/2-5-inch-submersible-impeller-pump\"><img alt=\"2.5 Inch Submersible Impeller Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/2-5-inch-submersible-impeller-pump29176943256a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a><